  "body": "Welcome to 72 Ara Taha Crescent, Orewa, a brand-new, standalone home combining contemporary design, generous outdoor space and easy single-level living.\r\n\r\nSet on a 272sqm freehold site, the home makes a warm first impression with its cedar cladding, landscaped front garden and modern architectural style. Inside, higher ceilings enhance the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a wonderful sense of space and openness.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxed everyday living, the kitchen and living areas connect seamlessly with the outdoors. Step out to the private backyard and entertaining area, an inviting space for summer gatherings, quiet afternoons or children to play. The elevated position also captures a pleasant outlook, adding to the home’s sense of privacy.\r\n\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two beautifully finished bathrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite. Two heat pumps provide year-round comfort, while the practical single-level layout makes daily life refreshingly easy.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage and two additional off-street parking spaces provide excellent convenience for households and visitors. With easy-care gardens and plenty of usable outdoor space, this home offers the room and privacy of a traditional property without demanding your weekends in return.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love:\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms and two stylish bathrooms\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n• Brand-new, standalone and single-level\r\n• Generous 272sqm freehold site\r\n• Contemporary design with warm cedar cladding\r\n• Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n• Higher ceilings enhancing space and natural light\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Private backyard and outdoor entertaining area\r\n• Elevated position with a pleasant outlook\r\n• Two heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n• Two additional off-street parking spaces\r\n• Landscaped front garden\r\n• Easy-care outdoor areas\r\n\r\nViewing Directions:\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout, enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign, then follow the directional signs to 72 Ara Taha Crescent.\r\n\r\nSet within Orewa’s growing Strathmill community, this home is ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, couples or small families seeking modern living with genuine outdoor space. The future Flavell Drive connection is expected to improve access towards State Highway 1, adding further convenience to the location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
